  <h1 style="font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 16px;">Your deposit has been received</h1>

  <p>Hi Pat,</p>

  
  <p>Thank you for registering for <strong>PC Summer Camp 2026</strong>. We've received your non-refundable deposit of <strong>£50.00</strong> covering 2 campers. A separate payment receipt has been emailed to you by Stripe.</p>
  

  <h2 style="font-size: 16px; margin: 24px 0 8px;">What happens next</h2>
  <ol style="padding-left: 20px;">
    <li><strong>15 - 30 June</strong> — Registration is open.</li>
    <li><strong>1 - 15 July</strong> — The committee allocates rooms. You'll hear from your cell leader, by email, in person, or at arrival on the day.</li>
    
    <li><strong>16 - 31 July</strong> — Final payment window. Once the balance is settled, your accommodation is fully confirmed.</li>
    
  </ol>

  
  <h2 style="font-size: 16px; margin: 24px 0 8px;">Parental consent form</h2>
  <p>One or more of the campers on your registration is under 18. Please <strong>print and sign</strong> the parental consent form and hand it to Bro Ash before the start of camp. We don't accept email scans.</p>
  
  

  <h2 style="font-size: 16px; margin: 24px 0 8px;">Questions?</h2>
  <p>If anything looks wrong, reply to this email or speak to your cell leader.</p>

  <p style="margin-top: 32px;">God bless,<br>The PC Summer Camp 2026 team</p>
</body>
